# Line endings are pinned here rather than left to each clone's core.autocrlf:
# a checkout can be shared between Windows git (core.autocrlf = true on Git for
# Windows) and WSL git, and a CRLF checkout breaks the skill scripts in WSL
# ("/bin/bash^M: bad interpreter"). LF everywhere; PowerShell reads LF fine.
* text=auto eol=lf
